[00:13.60]I thought the quiet had settled in
[00:15.56]Like dust on an ordinary day
[00:18.46]But nothing was still
[00:21.14]Not really
[00:23.26]There was a pulse in the corner
[00:25.10]A line under the skin
[00:26.24]A small kind of signal
[00:27.46]Finding its way back in
[00:28.70]Not loud
[00:29.38]Not obvious
[00:30.70]Not asking me
